{"title":"重磅！东莞城市更新，获财政部资金支持！","date":"2024-06-07","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.5pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">重磅！东莞城市更新，获财政部资金支持！</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.8pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.45pt\">近日，财政部网站发布《<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年城市更新行动评审结果公示》，首批<span lang=\"EN-US\">15</span>个城市拟获得财政部支持实施城市更新行动。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.45pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.45pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.8pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\ncolor:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.45pt\">15</span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.45pt\">个城市为（按行政区划排序）：石家庄、太原、沈阳、上海、南京、杭州、合肥、福州、南昌、青岛、武汉、<strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">东莞</strong>、重庆、成都、西安。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.45pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.45pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202406/%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%873.png\" style=\"width: 554px; height: 404px;\" />&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:21.0pt\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">日前，财政部、住建部联合印发《关于开展城市更新示范工作的通知》，根据通知，财政部会同住房城乡建设部通过竞争性选拔，确定部分基础条件好、积极性高、特色突出的城市开展典型示范，扎实有序推进城市更新行动。中央财政对示范城市给予定额补助。示范城市制定城市更新工作方案，统筹使用中央和地方资金，完善法规制度、规划标准、投融资机制及相关配套政策，结合开展城市地下管网更新改造、污水管网<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>厂网一体<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>建设改造、市政基础设施补短板、老旧片区更新改造等重点工作，不断推进城市更新工作。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 30pt; line-height: 21pt; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">城市更新示范工作支持对象是地级及以上城市。<strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span></strong><strong>年，每省（区、市）可推荐<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>个城市参评，首批评选<span lang=\"EN-US\">15</span>个示范城市，重点向超大特大城市和长江经济带沿线大城市倾斜，中央财政补助资金重点支持城市地下管网更新改造和污水管网<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>厂网一体<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>建设改造等。</strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;color:white;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;background:#225CB0\">中央财政资金补助标准：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">中央财政按区域对示范城市给予定额补助。其中：东部地区每个城市补助总额不超过<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>亿元，中部地区每个城市补助总额不超过<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>亿元，西部地区每个城市补助总额不超过<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>亿元，直辖市每个城市补助总额不超过<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>亿元。资金根据工作推进情况分年拨付到位。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;color:white;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;background:#225CB0\">资金支持方向：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">示范城市通过多种渠道筹集资金，系统化推进城市更新行动，统筹推进城市地下管网和综合管廊建设、污水管网&ldquo;厂网一体&rdquo;建设改造、市政基础设施补短板、老旧片区更新改造等工作，优化城市空间布局，完善城市功能。具体包括：</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.05pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">1.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">城市地下管网更新改造。</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">对城市燃气、热力、给排水、电力等城市地下管网实施更新改造，因地制宜推进城市地下综合管廊建设，提升城市地下管网整体水平。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.05pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">2.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">城市污水管网全覆盖样板区建设。</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">对污水处理管网按照<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>厂网一体<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>的模式进行更新改造，提升污水收集处理效能。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.05pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">3.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">市政基础设施补短板。</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">对生活垃圾分类、综合杆箱、物流设施等市政基础设施进行提升改造，补齐城市基础设施短板弱项；提升城市绿地服务功能，推进口袋公园建设和绿地开放共享。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.05pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">4.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">老旧片区更新改造。</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">对历史文化街区、既有公共建筑、公共空间等进行节能降碳等提升改造，持续改善建筑功能和提升生活环境品质。实施城市功能完善工程，推进适老化适儿化改造，加快公共场所无障碍环境建设改造。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">示范城市要按照因地制宜、因城施策的原则，突出本次城市更新的示范重点内容，有针对性的解决制约本城市发展的问题，避免面面俱到、&ldquo;撒胡椒面&rdquo;。同时，应与现有政策做好统筹衔接，具体项目上不得重复使用<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span>年增发国债资金、中央预算内投资、车购税资金、超长期特别国债等其他渠道中央财政资金，防止交叉重复。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>"}